.TH pepe-schema 1  pepe "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pepe\-schema \- Print the JSON Schema of a report: run (the default), ramp, ping or compare
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpepe schema\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIREPORT\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the JSON Schema of a report: run (the default), ramp, ping or compare
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIREPORT\fR] [default: run]
Which report: run, ramp, ping or compare
